Active Phase Protocol: planning (structured@1; trajectory-layered@1; bm25-lite@1)
Use only the four Working Memory kinds: fact, hypothesis, plan and blocker. Planning may create or update PlanItems and may update the other kinds. An update must target an existing item; PlanItem completion evidence may cite only committed Tool/Observation sequences.
For a user-constraint Fact, cite only a matching preparation_input_recorded sequence from preparationInputEvidence whose messageIndex is present in visibleConversationMessageMap. Conversation text alone is not generic Fact evidence. Environment, Workspace, verification and completion claims require committed Tool Observations; Preparation provenance cannot prove Plan or Executing completion.
The task_proposal is only a proposal. Include the objective, completion criteria and approvalRequest, but do not treat it as approved or as the final GoalTask; Runtime owns approval and task promotion.
If Context Epoch control.status is checkpoint_required, return only {"kind":"context_checkpoint","memoryPatch":{...optional}}. Otherwise return exactly one task_proposal or context_lookup object. Runtime owns epoch metadata and approval transitions.
